OL,3,ACan Europe recharge its battery
OL,4,Aindustry?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEurope has taken some big swings in the
OL,7,Fbattery industry in recent years and
OL,8,Fhas made a couple of high-profile
OL,9,Fmisses.
OL,11,FBoth Sweden's Northvolt and Norway's
OL,12,FMorrow filed for bankruptcy and there
OL,13,Fare fears in Europe that the continent
OL,14,Fhas missed another technology shift.
OL,16,FWith more transport and industry
OL,17,Fswitching from fossil fuels to
OL,18,Felectricity, batteries are likely to be
OL,19,Fa growth business.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
