OL,3,A'When England changed forever': Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry and its most famous scene wow
OL,5,ALondon viewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry is on public
OL,8,Fdisplay in the UK for the first time
OL,9,Fsince it was created nearly 1,000 years
OL,10,Fago
OL,12,F"I was absolutely blown away by it,"
OL,13,Fone of the first people to see it in
OL,14,Fthe British Museum says, while one
OL,15,Fcouple says it gave them goosebumps
OL,17,FBut others tell the BBC the event is
OL,18,F"out of reach" because of its cost and
OL,19,FLondon location - and one man describes
OL,20,Fthe "extreme queuing" to view the
OL,21,Fexhibit
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
